.TH PIPETUI 1 "September 2026" "PipeTUI 1.0.0" "PipeTUI DevOps CLI"

.SH NAME
pipetui \- lightweight DevOps pipeline CLI

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pipetui
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]

.B pipetui
.B --version

.SH DESCRIPTION
PipeTUI is a local DevOps command-line tool for registering projects, running builds,
executing pipelines, deploying applications, and inspecting history from a terminal.

.SH SYSTEM COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui
Launch the PipeTUI TUI (terminal user interface).

.TP
.B pipetui tui
Launch the PipeTUI interface.

.TP
.B pipetui start
Start the DevOps monitoring service.

.TP
.B pipetui status
Display the current status of the DevOps system.

.TP
.B pipetui reset
Clear all build, deployment, and alert history.

.SH PROJECT COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui project list
List all registered projects.

.TP
.B pipetui project add \fINAME\fR \fIPATH\fR
Register a new project with PipeTUI. The path must be a valid directory.

.TP
.B pipetui project edit \fINAME\fR [\fI--name NEW_NAME\fR] [\fI--path NEW_PATH\fR]
Update a project's name and/or filesystem path.

.TP
.B pipetui project delete \fINAME\fR
Delete a project and its related data.

.SH BUILD COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui build run \fIPROJECT\fR
Run a build for the specified project.

PipeTUI automatically detects the build system:

.RS
.nf
npm projects → npm run build
Makefile → make
Python build script → python build.py
.fi
.RE

.TP
.B pipetui build list [\fIPROJECT\fR]
Show build history. If PROJECT is specified, show builds for that project only.

.TP
.B pipetui build history
Alias for: pipetui build list

.TP
.B pipetui build logs \fIBUILD_ID\fR
Show output for a specific build. Use an integer BUILD_ID.

.TP
.B pipetui build show-logs \fIPROJECT\fR [\fI--last\fR] [\fI--id BUILD_ID\fR]
Show build logs for a project.
Use
.B --last
to show the most recent build log.
Use
.B --id BUILD_ID
to show logs for a specific build ID.

.TP
.B pipetui build tail \fIPROJECT\fR
Live stream build logs for a project. Press CTRL+C to stop.

.SH DEPLOYMENT COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui deploy run \fIPROJECT\fR \fIENVIRONMENT\fR
Deploy a project to a target environment.

.TP
.B pipetui deploy history
Display deployment history.

.SH LOG COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui logs show
Display all recorded logs.

.TP
.B pipetui logs filter \fILEVEL\fR
Filter logs by severity level (INFO, WARNING, ERROR).

.TP
.B pipetui logs build \fIBUILD_ID\fR
Show structured output for a build.

.SH PIPELINE COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui pipeline create \fIPROJECT\fR [\fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR]
Create an empty pipeline for a registered project. Defaults to "default" pipeline name.

.TP
.B pipetui pipeline list \fIPROJECT\fR
List all pipelines for a project.

.TP
.B pipetui pipeline edit \fIPROJECT\fR \fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR \fI--name NEW_NAME\fR
Rename a pipeline.

.TP
.B pipetui pipeline delete \fIPROJECT\fR \fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR
Delete a pipeline.

.TP
.B pipetui pipeline run \fIPIPELINE_REF\fR [\fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR] [\fI--name PIPELINE_NAME\fR]
Run a pipeline. PIPELINE_REF can be a project name or pipeline name.

.SH STEP COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui step list \fIPROJECT\fR \fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR
List all steps for a pipeline.

.TP
.B pipetui step add \fIPROJECT\fR \fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR \fISTEP_ORDER\fR \fICOMMAND\fR
Append a command step to a pipeline. STEP_ORDER must be the next sequential number.

.TP
.B pipetui step edit \fIPROJECT\fR \fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR \fISTEP_ORDER\fR \fICOMMAND\fR
Edit a pipeline step command.

.TP
.B pipetui step delete \fIPROJECT\fR \fIPIPELINE_NAME\fR \fISTEP_ORDER\fR
Delete a pipeline step.

.SH ALERT COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui alerts show
Display all system alerts.

.TP
.B pipetui alerts clear
Clear all alerts.

.SH DOCKER COMMANDS

.TP
.B pipetui docker deploy \fIPROJECT\fR \fIENVIRONMENT\fR
Deploy a project using Docker plugin to a target environment.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B -h, --help
Show help message and exit.

.TP
.B --version
Show version and exit.

.SH EXAMPLES

Register a project:

.nf
pipetui project add api ~/Projects/api
.fi

Create a pipeline:

.nf
pipetui pipeline create api myPipeline
.fi

Add steps to a pipeline:

.nf
pipetui step add api myPipeline 1 "npm install"
pipetui step add api myPipeline 2 "npm run build"
.fi

Run a pipeline:

.nf
pipetui pipeline run api myPipeline
.fi

Run a build:

.nf
pipetui build run api
.fi

Deploy to production:

.nf
pipetui deploy run api prod
.fi

View build history:

.nf
pipetui build list api
.fi

Show build logs:

.nf
pipetui build logs 1
.fi

Filter error logs:

.nf
pipetui logs filter ERROR
.fi

View all alerts:

.nf
pipetui alerts show
.fi

.SH FILES

.TP
.I devops.db
SQLite database used by PipeTUI, stored in the PipeTUI project directory.

.SH SEE ALSO
.B https://github.com/Tubsterlol/PipeTUI

.SH VERSION
PipeTUI 1.0.0